OL,3,A'I'm telling the truth': Earl Spencer
OL,4,Adefends Diana book claims about Charles
OL,5,Ain BBC interview
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrincess Diana's brother has told the
OL,8,FBBC exclusively that he is "telling the
OL,9,Ftruth" about a phone call with King
OL,10,FCharles in the days after his sister's
OL,11,Fdeath.
OL,13,FEarl Spencer claims in a new book the
OL,14,Fthen-Prince of Wales said "we'll forget
OL,15,Fher soon enough" during an argument
OL,16,Fover whether Princes William and Harry
OL,17,Fshould walk in Diana's funeral
OL,18,Fprocession.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
