OL,3,ADavey says Lib Dems are 'firewall
OL,4,Aagainst Farage' as conference begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing speculation about a possible
OL,7,Fsnap election, he said the party was
OL,8,Fready to fight and would build its
OL,9,Fso-called orange wall even higher by
OL,10,Fwinning more than its 2024 record of 72
OL,11,FMPs.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
