OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANato welcomes Greenland deal as Trump
OL,4,Asays it will give US 'permanent
OL,5,Asecurity control'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe leaders of Denmark and Greenland
OL,8,Fwelcomed the deal to "strengthen
OL,9,Fsecurity", saying it was expected to be
OL,10,Fsigned next week - but did not outline
OL,11,Fits contents.
OL,13,FThis comes after months of threats by
OL,14,FTrump to "take" Greenland over national
OL,15,Fsecurity concerns, citing its strategic
OL,16,Flocation for defence purposes and its
OL,17,Fmineral wealth.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
